// Declared registry of every JavaScript module on the runtime path of a chat turn or a UI action, grouped into the
// components the Worlds map shows. Each module carries its generality audit (specs/js-generality-audit.md):
//  generic       parsing, transport, rendering primitives, solver plumbing, storage, UI widgets: no domain decision;
//  domain-logic  per-area/per-kind branches, hardcoded words, kinds, thresholds, orderings, heuristics or fallbacks that
//                choose a result and belong in SOP rules or knowledge (evidence: file:line; replacement: the SOP piece);
//  data          JavaScript that only holds tables; sop-carrier: JavaScript that only exports SOP source text.
// secret: behaviour that can change a result without appearing in the trace or as a world-activity event.
// activity.operations: world-activity operations this component emits (the map lights the component for them);
// activity.nodeIds: records its events name directly (a decorated record lights for those events).
// tests/worlds-component-registry-declared-host.test.mjs fails when a reachable runtime module is missing here or a listed one is gone.
// Stewardship procedure: specs/worlds-inspector.md "Stewardship of the Worlds map".
